OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police urge students to move 7
OL,4,AOctober protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police is calling on
OL,7,Fthe organisers of a pro-Palestinian
OL,8,Fstudent march scheduled to take place
OL,9,Fon the third anniversary of the 7
OL,10,FOctober attacks on Israel to move the
OL,11,Fevent.
OL,13,FDeputy Assistant Commissioner James
OL,14,FHarman said the force had been unable
OL,15,Fto identify the organisers behind the
OL,16,Fgroup, which calls itself the
OL,17,FUniversity of London Coalition.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
