OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police urge students to move 7
OL,4,AOctober protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said that while the march did not
OL,7,Fmeet the strict legal threshold at
OL,8,Fwhich police could request the home
OL,9,Fsecretary to ban a protest, many
OL,10,FLondoners would be marking "a day of
OL,11,Fmourning" on Wednesday, with vigils
OL,12,Fbeing held to remember those killed on
OL,13,F7 October 2023.
OL,15,FThe BBC has also contacted the group
OL,16,Ffor comment.
